[H1]Overview:
Select the GPU architecture that matches your hardware. Multi-arch installers
support fine-grained architectures for precise GPU matching. Each entry
corresponds to a specific GPU model.

[H1]What is Multi-Arch?
Multi-arch installers contain components for multiple fine-grained GPU
architectures. This allows you to install ROCm optimized for your exact GPU
model, reducing installation size compared to installing all models.

[H1]Fine-Grained Architectures:
Unlike single-arch installers that use coarse families (gfx110x for all RDNA 3),
multi-arch installers let you select specific models.

  Single-arch example: gfx110x covers all RDNA 3 GPUs
  Multi-arch example: gfx1100 (Navi 31), gfx1101 (Navi 32), gfx1102 (Navi 33)

